{"1360810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Office Life", "steam_appid": 1360810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Define Your Own Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how harsh reality gets, here, you are the main character. <i>Office Life</i> is not just a simulator; it’s an interactive &quot;Zero-to-Hero&quot; saga featuring over 2 million words of branching narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360810/extras/1e05c09cf3255787d9e2c736944604dd.poster.avif?t=1785826450\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360810/extras/1e05c09cf3255787d9e2c736944604dd.webm?t=1785826450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360810/extras/1e05c09cf3255787d9e2c736944604dd.mp4?t=1785826450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start Your Corporate Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deeply realistic simulation of the corporate world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Corporate Warfare:</strong> Learn to pick sides in complex office politics, win high-stakes project bids, and navigate a minefield of cooperation and betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Relationships:</strong> Interact with hundreds of unique NPCs who are more than just quest givers. Will you make powerful allies or dangerous enemies? The choice is yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive &quot;Zero-to-Hero&quot; Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a fresh college graduate facing a world of infinite possibilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Career Paths:</strong> Experience the thrill of a meteoric rise. Climb the ladder to become an industry elite, or go rogue and start your own company to dominate the market in intense commercial battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Financial Freedom:</strong> Success isn't just about the 9-to-5. Trade stocks, invest in real estate, and amass a fortune to realize your dream of true financial freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Romantic Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn't just about work. Over a 10-year timeline, you will meet multiple charismatic and independent women.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Interaction:</strong> Unlock exclusive storylines and dating events for each heroine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Bonds:</strong> Will you stay loyal to one true love, or navigate a complex web of relationships? Get married, have children, and build a warm home in the cold city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Workplace Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve gamified office politics! Face difficult clients, shifting blame, and demanding bosses with a unique card system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:</strong> Build your deck from <strong>500+ cards</strong> representing work actions like &quot;Overtime,&quot; &quot;Slacking Off,&quot; and &quot;Report.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wit Wins:</strong> Use strategy to resolve crises and enjoy the thrill of outsmarting your opponents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Personal Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life begins after 5 PM!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Hustles:</strong> Write web novels, become a streamer, or deliver food. There are many ways to get rich!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work-Life Balance:</strong> Hit the gym, travel the world, buy luxury cars and mansions. Live your best life in the big city.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Define Your Own Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how harsh reality gets, here, you are the main character. <i>Office Life</i> is not just a simulator; it’s an interactive &quot;Zero-to-Hero&quot; saga featuring over 2 million words of branching narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360810/extras/1e05c09cf3255787d9e2c736944604dd.poster.avif?t=1785826450\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360810/extras/1e05c09cf3255787d9e2c736944604dd.webm?t=1785826450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360810/extras/1e05c09cf3255787d9e2c736944604dd.mp4?t=1785826450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start Your Corporate Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deeply realistic simulation of the corporate world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Corporate Warfare:</strong> Learn to pick sides in complex office politics, win high-stakes project bids, and navigate a minefield of cooperation and betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Relationships:</strong> Interact with hundreds of unique NPCs who are more than just quest givers. Will you make powerful allies or dangerous enemies? The choice is yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive &quot;Zero-to-Hero&quot; Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a fresh college graduate facing a world of inf